## =================================================================
## SCOPE ASSIGNMENTS
## =================================================================
## Classifies each documented object/frame by its profile scope.
## Objects without an explicit scope annotation are assumed
## profile:NordicProfile.
## -----------------------------------------------------------------

## --- Entur Extensions (defined in netex-entur.ttl / netex-rolling-stock.ttl) ---

netex:TrainBlock         profile:scope profile:EnturExtension .
netex:CompoundTrain      profile:scope profile:EnturExtension .
netex:Train              profile:scope profile:EnturExtension .

## --- Nordic Profile Candidates (Entur-driven, targeting NP harmonisation) ---

netex:Contract           profile:scope profile:NordicCandidate .

## --- Nordic Profile (all other objects default to this) ---
## Explicit for key classes; unlisted objects inherit NordicProfile.

netex:CompositeFrame     profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
netex:ResourceFrame      profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
netex:SiteFrame          profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
netex:ServiceCalendarFrame profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
netex:ServiceFrame       profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
netex:TimetableFrame     profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
netex:VehicleScheduleFrame profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
netex:FareFrame          profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
netex:SalesTransactionFrame profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
netex:FareContract       profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
netex:TrainNumber        profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
netex:Line               profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
netex:Route              profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
netex:JourneyPattern     profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
netex:ServiceJourney     profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
netex:DatedServiceJourney profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
netex:StopPlace          profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
netex:Quay               profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
