netex:PassengerStopAssignment profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
netex:DayType            profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
netex:DayTypeAssignment  profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
netex:OperatingPeriod    profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
netex:OperatingDay       profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
netex:Authority          profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
netex:Operator           profile:scope profile:NordicProfile .
